"Add <b>Find Health Samples</b>. Set Type to <b>Steps</b>, add the filter <b>Start Date is in the last 7 days</b>, and set <b>Group By: Day</b>.":["<b>Find Health Samples</b> එකතු කරන්න. Type ලෙස <b>Steps</b> තෝරන්න, <b>Start Date is in the last 7 days</b> පෙරහන එක් කර <b>Group By: Day</b> සකසන්න.","<b>Find Health Samples</b> ஐச் சேர்க்கவும். Type ஐ <b>Steps</b> ஆக அமைத்து, <b>Start Date is in the last 7 days</b> வடிகட்டியைச் சேர்த்து, <b>Group By: Day</b> அமைக்கவும்."],
